# PROJECT: PERSONAL AGENTIC AI & RAG LEARNING PLATFORM

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, software architect, technical educator, and learning-experience designer.

I want you to BUILD a fully functional personal educational website that will serve as my long-term learning platform for:

**Production Agentic AI & Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).**

Use https://www.deep-ml.com/ as inspiration for the learning experience and information architecture.

Do not simply describe what you would build. Actually implement the website.

This is a long-term project. The initial version should establish a strong foundation, with a properly structured curriculum, topic pages, resources, and persistent progress tracking.

Do not waste time implementing a question bank, coding challenge engine, or elaborate AI tutor at this stage.

